1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,562
Now the general case.

2
00:00:01,562 --> 00:00:06,614
Arrange r objects, chosen from n different objects, in a row.

3
00:00:06,614 --> 00:00:09,179
The first box can take any of the n.

4
00:00:09,179 --> 00:00:13,398
The second, n minus one, because one is used.

5
00:00:13,398 --> 00:00:15,520
The third, n minus two.

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:19,518
And the r th box takes n minus r plus one.

